- Primary: Fender Rhodes Mark I & Wurlitzer 200A electric pianos (routed through analog tape tremolo, space delays, and granular pitch shifters).
- Electronic & Rhythmic: Elektron Machinedrum, Roland Juno-106, Mutable Instruments Clouds, Eurorack stochastic rhythm generators.
- Atmospheric: VLF (Very Low Frequency) atmospheric radio receivers, magnetic induction coil microphones, Eventide H3000 harmonizers.

